WEBVTT

00:05:58.510 --> 00:06:02.370
The Orbiter had placed
itself in Mars’s orbit.

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:05.555
(Applause)

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:12.210
I couldn’t believe that we had achieved
this historic success.

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:16.200
The Mars Mission was the world's first
mission to have successfully completed

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:19.820
a revolution around Mars
in its first attempt.

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:25.410
This was the cheapest mission in the world
from one planet to another.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:29.310
This was the first Indian satellite
to have full-scale, on-board autonomy,

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:32.960
which means having the capability
to rectify its own faults and problems.